          "id": 2863779172,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "```\n[1/157] Generating sgp22-exp.cnf\nFAILED: epan/dissectors/asn1/sgp22/sgp22-exp.cnf build/epan/dissectors/asn1/sgp22/sgp22-exp.cnf \ncd build/epan/dissectors/asn1/sgp22 && python3.11 source/tools/asn2wrs.py -E -b -q -L -p sgp22 -c source/epan/dissectors/asn1/sgp22/sgp22.cnf -D source/epan/dissectors/asn1/sgp22 PEDefinitions.asn RSPDefinitions.asn\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"source/tools/asn2wrs.py\", line 8299, in <module>\n    asn2wrs_main()\n  File \"source/tools/asn2wrs.py\", line 8193, in asn2wrs_main\n    ectx.conform.read(conf_to_read)\n  File \"source/tools/asn2wrs.py\", line 2661, in read\n    fnew = open(fname, \"r\")\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nFileNotFoundError: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: '../pkix1implicit/pkix1implicit-exp.cnf'\n```",
