        {
          "id": 2863792579,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "When does this happen for you?\n\nI have seen this happen before, but only a very few ASN.1 dissectors uses `EXPORT_DEPENDS` to set CMake dependency. I think we should have a look at setting dependencies based on `EXTRA_CNF` instead. Then every ASN.1 dissector will get all needed dependencies.",
